      <VERS vnumber="8"> Nevertheless he <gr str="3467">saved </gr>them for his name's <gr str="4616 8034">sake</gr>, that he might make <gr str="*853" />his mighty <gr str="1369">power </gr>to be <gr str="3045">known</gr>. </VERS>
