      <VERS vnumber="29"> Thus they provoked <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> him </STYLE> to <gr str="3707">anger </gr>with their <gr str="4611">inventions</gr>: and the <gr str="4046">plague </gr>broke <gr str="6555">in </gr>upon them. </VERS>
