      <VERS vnumber="39"> Thus were they <gr str="2930">defiled </gr>with their own <gr str="4639">works</gr>, and went a <gr str="2181">whoring </gr>with their own <gr str="4611">inventions</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="40"> Therefore was the <gr str="639">wrath </gr>of the <gr str="3068">LORD </gr>
